{"id":"2b4ca4256cf9a974baac9267","source":"ru-ria-tg","source_name":"RIA Novosti","platform":"telegram","url":"https://t.me/rian_ru/350204","published_at":"2026-11-21T00:50:59Z","collected_at":"2026-11-21T00:54:59.255890Z","title":"","text":"В МВД рассказали о мошеннической схеме с «перерасчетом» платежей за ЖКУ. Аферисты создают в мессенджере закрытые чаты, где от имени энергосбытовой компании сообщают о перерасчете коммунальных платежей. Поначалу они требуют оперативно подтвердить опубликованные там данные с указанием ФИО и даты рождения. Далее мошенники рассылают сообщение о завершении процедуры верификации и просят перейти в чат-бот, который запрашивает шестизначный код. После получения кода мошенники получают доступ к аккаунтам жертв. 🔹 Подписаться / Мы в \"Максе\"","html":"","media":[],"author":"RIA Novosti","language":"und","group":"official-ru","perspective":"russian","trust":"primary","tags":[],"raw":{"archive_policy":"public_excerpt_v1","content_sha256":"7e2b847e8602705c60996c5eb4cae37e4735d68d9af1e60c58dee2ed44a06305","original_text_chars":536,"original_html_chars":5367,"text_truncated":false,"media_count":3,"platform":{"post":"rian_ru/350204"}}}
{"id":"ab32c2181a99e27ac95422a5","source":"guardian-rss","source_name":"The Guardian World","platform":"rss","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/21/victorian-greens-seek-urgent-injunction-over-how-to-vote-cards-mimicking-branding-but-preferencing-it-last-ntwnfb","published_at":"2026-11-21T00:26:56Z","collected_at":"2026-11-21T00:54:50.113244Z","title":"Victorian Greens seek urgent injunction over how-to-vote cards mimicking party’s branding but preferencing it last","text":"An amended how-to-vote card distributed by Tosh-Jake Finnigan's campaign after a legal threat from the Greens. View image in fullscreen An amended how-to-vote card distributed by Tosh-Jake Finnigan's campaign after a legal threat from the Greens. Victoria state election 2026 Victorian Greens seek urgent injunction over how-to-vote cards mimicking party’s branding but preferencing it last Exclusive: Independent candidate Tosh-Jake Finnigan’s cards instruct people to vote in a way that would benefit Liberal party Get our daily political email , free app or daily news podcast Henry Belot Fri 20 Nov 2026 19.26 EST Last modified on Fri 20 Nov 2026 19.28 EST Share Prefer the Guardian on Google The Victorian Greens are seeking an urgent injunction from the supreme court to stop an independent candidate distributing how-to-vote cards that allegedly mimic the party’s branding and urge people to preference it last. As prepoll opened on Wednesday morning, Tosh-Jake Finnigan’s campaign team handed out how-to-vote cards that used the minor party’s colour scheme, font and triangle logo with the banner “Vote 1 Green Values”. The card instructed people to vote in a way that would ultimately benefi","html":"","media":["https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/96ab340872e588ad309196b07390be6b1c05c064/0_0_935_748/master/935.jpg?width=465&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none","https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/a158a3c6df985e76ee959db55dc33c58a9a14a93/0_0_1206_1596/master/1206.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none"],"author":"Henry Belot","language":"und","group":"international-media","perspective":"mixed","trust":"high","tags":[],"raw":{"archive_policy":"public_excerpt_v1","content_sha256":"bfb1d242974b94182a7395cd3d1ce79cf6a2b27dd47c63fb5df4e656f3fbe0f6","original_text_chars":5362,"original_html_chars":21403,"text_truncated":true,"media_count":2,"platform":{"entry_id":"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/21/victorian-greens-seek-urgent-injunction-over-how-to-vote-cards-mimicking-branding-but-preferencing-it-last-ntwnfb","entry_link":"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/21/victorian-greens-seek-urgent-injunction-over-how-to-vote-cards-mimicking-branding-but-preferencing-it-last-ntwnfb"}}}
{"id":"81d3b9dd7eac3c4a9438ecd7","source":"guardian-rss","source_name":"The Guardian World","platform":"rss","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/20/trump-republican-succession-battle-vance-rubio","published_at":"2026-11-21T00:16:26Z","collected_at":"2026-11-21T00:55:37.677529Z","title":"Trump turns White House press conference into a 2028 succession audition","text":"Donald Trump gestures as he speaks during a press conference after returning from Asia, with JD Vance and Marco Rubio in the back on 20 November. Photograph: Evelyn Hockstein/Reuters View image in fullscreen Donald Trump gestures as he speaks during a press conference after returning from Asia, with JD Vance and Marco Rubio in the back on 20 November. Photograph: Evelyn Hockstein/Reuters Trump administration Analysis Trump turns White House press conference into a 2028 succession audition David Smith in Washington The president appeared to put Vance and Rubio through their paces as potential successors, though Stephen Miller unexpectedly stole the spotlight Fri 20 Nov 2026 19.16 EST Last modified on Fri 20 Nov 2026 19.18 EST Share “Which of you shall we say doth love us most?” The ageing King Lear’s question to his daughters, expecting them to compete for his favour and carve up his kingdom, hovered in the White House press briefing room on Friday. There at the lectern stood Donald “Lear” Trump. Behind him stood his potential heirs, JD “Goneril” Vance and Marco “Regan” Rubio, and to the side sat Trump’s favourite offspring, Stephen “Cordelia” Miller (more of him later). As for Lear","html":"","media":["https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/13a779743e2a0f56e66622d1d81ea56493964bed/0_0_5444_3631/master/5444.jpg?width=465&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none"],"author":"David Smith in Washington","language":"und","group":"international-media","perspective":"mixed","trust":"high","tags":[],"raw":{"archive_policy":"public_excerpt_v1","content_sha256":"7479be7b49e790e22d5c4daf8655a18ebc5b4de33d167b32cb7a7530572c2699","original_text_chars":8361,"original_html_chars":20345,"text_truncated":true,"media_count":1,"platform":{"entry_id":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/20/trump-republican-succession-battle-vance-rubio","entry_link":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/20/trump-republican-succession-battle-vance-rubio"}}}
{"id":"6b6187c3c13820dc76dee14d","source":"guardian-rss","source_name":"The Guardian World","platform":"rss","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/20/dolores-huerta-celebration-of-life-california","published_at":"2026-11-21T00:03:47Z","collected_at":"2026-11-21T00:55:38.291782Z","title":"‘A source of inspiration’: California celebrates the late civil rights icon Dolores Huerta","text":"Sudarshan Kapoor speaks at a memorial service and celebration of life for Dolores Huerta in Bakersfield, California, on 20 November 2026. Photograph: Mike Blake/Reuters View image in fullscreen Sudarshan Kapoor speaks at a memorial service and celebration of life for Dolores Huerta in Bakersfield, California, on 20 November 2026. Photograph: Mike Blake/Reuters California ‘A source of inspiration’: California celebrates the late civil rights icon Dolores Huerta A public vigil and celebration of life honor the civil rights activist and co-founder of United Farm Workers union Maria G Ortiz-Briones Fri 20 Nov 2026 19.03 EST First published on Fri 20 Nov 2026 10.00 EST Share Prefer the Guardian on Google Hundreds of people came out to honor and celebrate the life and legacy of the California civil rights activist Dolores Huerta at a celebration-of-life event Friday in Bakersfield. Huerta’s daughter Lori de Leon thanked attendees for their support during her mother’s passing, highlighting the widespread tributes and communities gathering in her honor. Huerta’s casket was escorted inside the Dignity Health arena for the interfaith memorial service as Mariachi Lindas Mexicanas played next ","html":"","media":["https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/ef6050eb4c4b9add95f09fc0cda7268617be4a43/0_0_4380_2925/master/4380.jpg?width=465&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none","https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/0e3989d99c2cb6f84a19912519ae11b787d17443/0_0_5500_3667/master/5500.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none","https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/54d84241cbcf8672dbff7fafe65a8030d17aecbc/0_0_5500_3667/master/5500.jpg